      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/West_Lake_Hills%2C_Texas",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Locally called “Westlake,” the city is a suburb west of central Austin, known for its scenic hill country setting.",
